<title>USA: TABLE - Walbro Corp Q2 net, sales fall.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Walbro Corp Q2 net, sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>CASS CITY, Mich. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					June 30	     June 30</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	    $153,841   $155,086   $307,861   $308,052</p>
<p> Net income		1,184	4,824	3,546	9,358</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share    .14	  .56	  .41	 1.08</p>
<p>Average Shares</p>
<p> Outstanding	 8,669,264  8,658,608  8,665,882  8,645,755</p>
<p> EBITDA*		  15,158     17,274     32,906     34,199</p>
<p>*  Earnings before interest and taxes, plus depreciation and amortization.</p>
<p>	     (In thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 sales reduced by $3.6 million and earnings by $1 million or $0.11 a share as result of impact of 29-day strike at Chrysler Corp.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
